\section{Conclusions}

In this paper, we used a joint application of CCW and $\delta$-passivity to develop convergence results for payoff mechanisms with first order modifications and $\delta$-passive evolutionary dynamics with the potential inclusion of the best response dynamics. Prior work had shown the effectiveness of CCW \cite{Martins_2025aa} and $\delta$-passivity \cite{Park2018Payoff-Dynamic-}, separately, in providing convergence or stability results, but this work has demonstrated the potential of their joint application through the treatment of a first order payoff modification.

Future work could further study the implications of (\ref{eq:dto0}) and the restrictions it poses on the population state and payoff trajectories through consideration of the structure of the best response set.

