	\]

	Step 2: By applying Kirchhoff's Current Law (KCL) to node 1, where the voltage is $v_{1}$, we have

	\[ 
	\frac{v_{1}-12.3}{10}+\frac{v_{1}}{4}+\frac{v_{1}-v_{2}}{20}=0
