ng a strong foundational framework for further refinement. They noted that the AI-generated content effectively captured the intended learning objectives and included realistic, contextually appropriate scenarios that aligned with the strategies outlined in the lessons. However, the designers also identified critical limitations. Specifically, they observed that the LLM-generated lessons lacked detailed explanatory feedback for incorrect answers. Additionally, they highlighted issues with clarity in the instructional content. These findings underscore the potential of LLMs as a tool for lesson generation while highlighting areas for improvement to ensure their outputs meet the nuanced demands of educational content creation.


