\subsubsection{Prefetching Performance}

Figure~\ref{fig:pref_acc} shows the prefetch accuracy of \ourwork~and the baselines. DART-S, DART, and DART-L achieve prefetch accuracy at 80.6\%, 80.7\%, and 82.5\%, respectively. While TransFetch-I and Voyager-I achieve the two highest accuracy values at 89.6\% and 95.1\%, their performance drops significantly with latency introduced in simulation to 78.6\% and 49.9\%. BO as a rule-based prefetcher shows high prefetch accuracy at 89.4\%.



