\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}
In conclusion, applying utility-based attribution methods to RAG with a tailored utility function shows promise. However, more advanced methods that account for deeper inter-document relationships are needed to improve attribution quality. As demonstrated in the final experiment, attribution scores alone may be insufficient; interpreting the interactions among highly attributed documents is also essential for a more complete understanding.


